-- macOS Homebrew: install pkgconf, libgit2 and libarchive.
-- Export PKG_CONFIG_PATH before Cabal's solver runs, for example:
-- PKG_CONFIG_PATH=/opt/homebrew/opt/libarchive/lib/pkgconfig cabal build
-- Use /usr/local/opt/libarchive/lib/pkgconfig on Intel Homebrew.
-- No repository shell wrapper is needed.
